? (rooms checked)", "label_es": "If no, why not? (rooms checked)", "type": "text"}, {"id": "f19", "label_en": "Were doors and windows closed?", "label_es": "Were doors and windows closed?", "type": "radio", "options": [{"value": "Yes", "en": "Yes", "es": "Yes"}, {"value": "No", "en": "No", "es": "No"}]}, {"id": "f20", "label_en": "If no, why not? (doors/windows)", "label_es": "If no, why not? (doors/windows)", "type": "text"}]}, {"title_en": "DISASTER DRILL", "title_es": "DISASTER DRILL", "fields": [{"id": "f31", "label_en": "Time of Disaster Drill", "label_es": "Time of Disaster Drill", "type": "time"}, {"id": "f32", "label_en": "Date of Disaster Drill", "label_es": "Date of Disaster Drill", "type": "date"}, {"id": "f33", "label_en": "Type of Disaster Drill", "label_es": "Type of Disaster Drill", "type": "text"}, {"id": "f34", "label_en": "Procedure in Safety Plan Followed?", "label_es": "Procedure in Safety Plan Followed?", "type": "radio", "options": [{"value": "Yes", "en": "Yes", "es": "Yes"}, {"value": "No", "en": "No", "es": "No"}]}, {"id": "f35", "label_en": "CO2 Detector", "label_es": "CO2 Detector", "type": "checkboxes", "options": [{"value": "co2_ok", "en": "Carbon Monoxide (CO2) detector was tested and functioning well", "es": "Carbon Monoxide (CO2) detector was tested and functioning well"}]}]}, {"title_en": "SAFETY PLAN REVIEW", "title_es": "SAFETY PLAN REVIEW", "fields": [{"id": "f41", "label_en": "I have reviewed the Safety Plan with (Individual’s Name)", "label_es": "I have reviewed the Safety Plan with (Individual’s Name)", "type": "text"}, {"id": "f42", "label_en": "Date Reviewed (with individual)", "label_es": "Date Reviewed (with individual)", "type": "date"}, {"id": "f43", "label_en": "Safety Plan Reviewed By (Provider’s Name)", "label_es": "Safety Plan Reviewed By (Provider’s Name)", "type": "text"}, {"id": "f44", "label_en": "Date Reviewed (by provider)", "label_es": "Date Reviewed (by provider)", "type": "date"}, {"id": "f45", "label_en": "Area of Safety Plan Reviewed", "label_es": "Area of Safety Plan Reviewed", "type": "text"}, {"id": "f46", "label_en": "Does Safety Plan reflect the needs of the Individual?", "label_es": "Does Safety Plan reflect the needs of the Individual?", "type": "radio", "options": [{"value": "Yes", "en": "Yes", "es": "Yes"}, {"value": "No", "en": "No, see comments", "es": "No, see comments"}]}, {"id": "f47", "label_en": "CO2 Detector Confirmation", "label_es": "CO2 Detector Confirmation", "type": "checkboxes", "options": [{"value": "co2_confirm", "en": "Carbon Monoxide (CO2) detector was tested and functioning well", "es": "Carbon Monoxide (CO2) detector was tested and functioning well"}]}]}, {"title_en": "REVIEW", "title_es": "REVIEW", "fields": [{"id": "f51", "label_en": "Recommendations / Comments", "label_es": "Recommendations / Comments", "type": "textarea"}, {"id": "f60", "label_en": "Completed By: Provider Signature (typed)", "label_es": "Completed By: Provider Signature (typed)", "type": "signature"}, {"id": "f61", "label_en": "Completion Date", "label_es": "Completion Date", "type": "date"}, {"id": "f62", "label_en": "Reviewed By: Real Care, Inc. Representative (typed)", "label_es": "Reviewed By: Real Care, Inc. Representative (typed)", "type": "text"}, {"id": "f63", "label_en": "Review Date", "label_es": "Review Date", "type": "date"}, {"id": "f70", "type": "info", "label_en": "", "label_es": "", "body_en": "Submit documentation no later than the 3rd of the following month. Email: documentation@realcarecolorado.com", "body_es": "Submit documentation no later than the 3rd of the following month. Email: documentation@realcarecolorado.com"}]}]}'::jsonb, false, 1, 'safety', false, false, 'Converted from the intranet Gravity Form (FIRE-DISASTER-SAFETY_gravityforms-export.json). Draft until Real Care checks it against the original.', 'Convertido del formulario de la intranet. Borrador hasta que Real Care lo revise.');
