support may be needed:", "type": "textarea"}, {"id": "f15", "label_en": "Requests", "label_es": "Requests", "type": "checkboxes", "options": [{"value": "additional_services", "en": "Additional Services Requested", "es": "Additional Services Requested"}]}, {"id": "f16", "type": "info", "label_en": "", "label_es": "", "body_en": "Medication Administration Verification\n\nBy checking the box below, I acknowledge that I have verified all aspects of medication management for this period.\nI have verified that all medications have an active prescription on file; all medications on site are accurate to the prescription;\nand that the Natural Support has given the prescribed medications and as‑needed medications for the correct purpose and in accordance\nwith instructions from the prescriber (Right Person, Medication, Dose, Purpose, Time, Route, Frequency). The person receiving the medication\nwas monitored for side effects and documentation completed as needed. All medical personnel were notified as needed.", "body_es": "Medication Administration Verification\n\nBy checking the box below, I acknowledge that I have verified all aspects of medication management for this period.\nI have verified that all medications have an active prescription on file; all medications on site are accurate to the prescription;\nand that the Natural Support has given the prescribed medications and as‑needed medications for the correct purpose and in accordance\nwith instructions from the prescriber (Right Person, Medication, Dose, Purpose, Time, Route, Frequency). The person receiving the medication\nwas monitored for side effects and documentation completed as needed. All medical personnel were notified as needed."}, {"id": "f17", "label_en": "Verification Acknowledgment", "label_es": "Verification Acknowledgment", "type": "checkboxes", "options": [{"value": "verify", "en": "I verify the statement above for this period.", "es": "I verify the statement above for this period."}]}, {"id": "f18", 